@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Tell assistive technology what happened
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Child" as actor
participant "Screen reader" as sr
box "Frontend — game application" #E0F2FE
  participant "GameSetupPage" as setup
  participant "DuelPage" as duel
  participant "RoomPage" as room
  participant "joinRefusal" as words
end box
box "Frontend — components library" #E0F2FE
  participant "ToggleChips" as choice
  participant "Duel's live region" as live
  participant "Alert" as alert
end box
box "Frontend — api library" #E0F2FE
  participant "GAME_SESSION" as session
  participant "RoomsApi" as rooms
end box
== A choice ==
actor -> choice : Press a kind of maths (touch, Space or Enter)
choice --> setup : chosen
setup -> choice : on includes it
choice -> sr : aria-pressed="true" and a tick or a dot (L2-051 criterion 3)
== A duel ==
session --> duel : DuelState: new flash card, decided, or frozen
duel -> duel : DuelWords.announcement(DuelState)
duel -> live : "New card: {flash card}. Shout it!", "Not {answer}. Frozen for one second." or a result
live -> sr : Announce assertively (L2-051 criterion 4)
== An error ==
actor -> room : Join with a code
room -> rooms : joinRoom(code, kid, nickname)
rooms --> room : ApiError with code room_not_found
room -> words : joinRefusal(ApiError)
words --> room : "Hmm, no room with that code. Check the letters?"
room -> alert : message; the input carries aria-invalid
alert -> sr : role="alert" announces the words (L2-051 criterion 5)
alert --> actor : The same words on the screen
== The skip link ==
actor -> duel : Tab, then Enter on "Skip to the game"
duel -> duel : SkipLink focuses the main part (tabindex -1); the address stays
duel --> actor : The next Tab goes on from the main part (L2-051 criterion 1)
@enduml
